# Token efficiency

## Prompting
- One task per message. Name the path (`apps/web/...`, `apps/api/...`, `apps/mobile/...`).
- Prefer `@file` / `@folder` over `@Codebase`. Never dump full CI logs — link the run URL; paste 10–30 failing lines max.
- Start a new chat for unrelated work (don't reuse huge threads).

## Agent behavior
- Grep/search before reading; read only the function/region needed.
- Touch only the app tree in scope (web ≠ api ≠ mobile).
- Minimal diffs: fix root cause; no drive-by refactors or unsolicited docs.
- Don't re-run full E2E unless UI journeys/Playwright config changed.
- Don't regenerate lockfiles unless deps actually changed.

## Models & modes
- Fast/default model for lint, config, small diffs.
- Stronger model only for RAG/AI logic, cross-app refactors, or ambiguous prod failures.
- Plan mode for multi-file architecture; Agent for implementation.
- Prefer `workflow_dispatch` / path-filtered CI for unrelated areas.
